msgid "TOME_SEA@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of the Siren"

msgid "TOME_SEA@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"“If you swim effortlessly in the deep oceans, ride the waves to and from the "
"shore, if you can breathe under water and dine on the deep treasures of the "
"seas; mark my words, those who dwell on the rocks carrying nets will try to "
"reel you into their catch.\""

msgid "TOME_SEA@TOME@LORE_AUTHOR"
msgstr "C. JoyBell C."

msgid "TOME_SEA@TOME@GAMEPLAY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Harness the deadly beauty of the sea. Enthrall, Distract, and bury your foes "
"in Misfortune."

msgid "TOME_SEA@SKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Call of the Deep"

msgid "TOME_SEA@SKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Summons a tier II water creature on target water hex. (Requires basic "
"seafaring.)"

msgid "TOME_SEA@UNIT1@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Flash Flood"

msgid "TOME_SEA@UNIT1@ABILITY1@DESC"
msgstr "Enemies sustain damage:"

msgid "TOME_SEA@UNIT1@ABILITY2@NAME"
msgstr "Enthralling Gaze"

msgid "TOME_SEA@UNIT1@ABILITY2@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Enemies in a 1-hex radius has a 60% chance to be {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"ENTHRALLED.Hyperlink} "

msgid "TOME_SEA@SKILL_2@NAME"
msgstr "Captivating Dance"

msgid "TOME_SEA@SKILL_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target owned city for each population:[bulletlist][bullet/]+1 {GLOBAL."
"CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]+1 {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink}. "
"[bullet/]-1 {GLOBAL.UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]-1 {GLOBAL."
"ManaConcept.Hyperlink} "

msgid "TOME_SEA@SKILL_3@NAME"
msgstr "Essence of Beauty"

msgid "TOME_SEA@SKILL_3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Coalesce with the essence of the siren and curse those would destroy true "
"beauty. When attacked, attackers have a 60% chance to suffer {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.MISFORTUNE.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_SEA@SKILL_4@NAME"
msgstr "Undersea Garden"

msgid "TOME_SEA@SKILL_4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"+2 {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink} per "
"Coastal Province."

msgid "TOME_SEA@SKILL_5@NAME"
msgstr "Song of the Siren"

msgid "TOME_SEA@SKILL_5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"All units in target enemy army:[bulletlist][bullet/]Sustain 10 {GLOBAL."
"PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Suffer 2 stacks of the {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.MISFORTUNE.Hyperlink} status effect for 3 turns.[/bulletlist][br/]"
"[br/]Armies on a coast, open water, or a river tile additionally sustain:"
"[bulletlist][bullet/]Suffer the {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.ENTHRALLED.Hyperlink} "
"Status Effect for 3 turns."

msgid "TOME_SEA@SKILL_6@NAME"
msgstr "Storm Siren"

msgid "TOME_SEA@SKILL_6@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Storm Siren"

msgid "TOME_SEA@HERO_SKILL@NAME"
msgstr "Voice of Confusion"

msgid "TOME_SEA@HERO_SKILL@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target enemy unit is inflicted with {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.INSANITY.Hyperlink} "
"with a 90% chance. If unsuccessful, inflict 2x {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MISFORTUNE."
"Hyperlink} instead."

msgid "TOME_SEA@PROVINCE_IMPROVEMENT1@NAME"
msgstr "[Conduit/] Siren's Cove"

msgid "TOME_SEA@PROVINCE_IMPROVEMENT1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]Must be built on a Coastal province.[bullet/]+5 {GLOBAL."
"ManaConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]+3 {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink} per each "
"adjacent Coastal and Sea province.[bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL."
"ConduitConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]Acts like a {GLOBAL.TeleporterConcept."
"Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_SEA@HOTO@NAME"
msgstr "Hand of the Ocean"

msgid "TOME_SEA@HOTO@DESC"
msgstr "Terraforms a friendly non-water province into a partial water province"

msgid "TOME_SEA@HOTO@PASSIVE"
msgstr ""
"Owner of this tome learns the {GLOBAL.SPECIAL_OPERATIONS.HAND_OF_THE_OCEAN."
"Hyperlink} spell"

